stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unregistered

    Unregistered --> OwnedLocal: register(actor_id, owner_core = self)
    Unregistered --> OwnedRemote: register(actor_id, owner_core = other)

    OwnedLocal --> OwnedRemote: transfer() / migrateActor() to another core
    OwnedRemote --> OwnedLocal: transfer() / migrateActor() to this core
    OwnedRemote --> OwnedRemote: transfer() to a different remote core

    OwnedLocal --> Unregistered: unregister()
    OwnedRemote --> Unregistered: unregister()

    state OwnedLocal {
        [*] --> Idle
        Idle --> Executing: mailbox_router.route() -> local
        Executing --> Idle: message processed
    }

    note right of OwnedRemote
        Pinned actors (descriptor.pinned_core != null)
        can only ever be "migrated" to their own
        pinned core - migrateActor() rejects any
        other target with PinnedElsewhere.
    end note
